!include ../_style.puml

title 登入Session狀態機圖

[*] --> anonymous : initialize [no token] / show login
[*] --> unavailable : initialize [token exists] / call GET /auth/me
unavailable --> authenticated : restoreSuccess [public user valid] / cache verified user
unavailable --> invalid : restoreError [401 or 403] / clear token and user
unavailable --> unavailable : restoreError [network or 5xx] / keep persisted session
authenticated --> forbidden : enterAdmin [role != admin] / keep valid normal session
forbidden --> authenticated : enterNormalApp / route to role dashboard
authenticated --> invalid : protectedRequest [401 or 403] / clear invalid session
authenticated --> anonymous : logout / clear token and user
invalid --> anonymous : acknowledge / show login

note right of unavailable
  對應設計類別：AuthSession。
  暫時性錯誤不得直接清除仍可能有效的憑證。
end note

@enduml
